 ],
 "notes": "The role's trust policy is not specified in the prompt, so it is unchecked. Private means MapPublicIpOnLaunch is not true; route tables are not tested because the prompt does not mention them. sg_permits_subnets accepts a security-group source without proving it is the group itself, because no op compares two attributes of one resource (Partial, kept on purpose). same_key compares the referenced key, so a template using the key for one resource and its alias for the other fails it.",
 "lang": "cfn",
